<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first round matches in the men's Kremlin Cup tennis tournament:</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Tim Henman (Britain) 6-2 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat Sebastian Lareau (Canada) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat 5-Alex Corretja (Spain) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>7-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Jorge Burillo (Spain) 7-6 (7-4) 6-7 (4-6) 6-4</p>
<p>Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>3-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-4 6-3.</p>
</text>
